This Assert checks two conditions.

1. If New_Ret is negative (indicating the item was not found), the Count of the list should remain the same before and after the IndexOf operation.
2. If New_Ret is non-negative (meaning the item was found and its index returned), the Count of the list should not remain the same before and after the IndexOf operation because that would indicate a new item has been added to the list.

Please note, this would add an extra pre-condition which assumes that the IndexOf operation is always performed on a valid item that is guaranteed to be in the list (otherwise, the assertion would fail). The actual code would vary based on the specifics of the ArrayList.IndexOf method and the pre-conditions on the inputs. Also, these assert statements will run time when Debug mode is enabled.--------------------```cs
